### Opening the Code Spell Checker document information panel

1. {{::vs.Vscode_OpenCommand_1}}

2. {{::vs.Vscode_OpenCommand_2}} *- orange ring*

3. {{::vs.Vscode_OpenCommand_3}} `Show Spell Checker Info`. *- red ring*

4. Select *Show Spell Checker Configuration Info**. *- yellow ring*

{{::il.Vscode_CodeSpellChecker_Info_Open_img}}


5. The **Code Spell Checker** panel opens in the **Primary Sidebar**. *- red ring*

> **Note:** Which ever text document has focus will have its details displayed in the **Code Spell Checker** panel. *- yellow, green, blue rings*

6. The **Code Spell Checker** button appears in the **Activity Bar**. *- orange ring*

{{::il.Vscode_CodeSpellChecker_Info_Panel_img}}

